  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">FPE: AR-L1013 Programa de Competitividad del Norte Grande</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">PEF: AR-L1013 Norte Grande Competitiveness Program</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="ES">El objetivo de este financiamiento es apoyar a la Subsecretara de Coordinacin Econmica para: (i) llevar a cabo actividades necesarias para culminar la preparacin y puesta en marcha del Programa de Apoyo a la Competitividad del Norte Grande (AR- L 1013); y (ii) Realizar un Ejercicio Piloto en dos provincias del la Regin del Norte Grande.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The objective of this financing is to support to the Undersecretary&apos;s office of Economic Coordination for: (i) to carry out the necessary activities to culminate the preparation and beginning of the Support Program for Competitiveness of the Great North (AR-L1013); and (ii) execute a preliminary exercise in two provinces of the Great North Region.</narrative>
  </description>
